WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.090
Hi, I'm Shiora Inkstorm.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:13.442
I help with reading and writing. I help you scaffold hard texts, write close-reading questions, and support every reader in the room.

00:00:13.592 --> 00:00:21.034
For example, ask me: scaffold this Shakespeare passage for ninth graders who read below grade level.
